      "body": "## Motivation\r\n\r\nFixes #65070. CPU WNA16 MoE supported grouped INT4 weights but had no expert\r\nimplementation for grouped INT8 weight-only layers, so mixed INT4/INT8\r\ncompressed-tensors checkpoints failed during backend selection.\r\n\r\n## Modifications\r\n\r\n- Add a CPU grouped-INT8 WNA16 fallback that dequantizes weights to BF16 and\r\n  reuses the existing AMX unquantized MoE kernel.\r\n- Keep the existing optimized INT4 CPU path unchanged.\r\n- Add coverage for INT8 capability selection and grouped dequantization.\r\n\r\n",
